.claude/

# Small, hash-bound exceptions: committed evidence frames/clips and the painted test inputs the GPU harness needs inside the git bundle
!docs/evidence/**/*.png
!docs/evidence/**/*.mp4
!assets/ltx_test_inputs/**/*.png
